       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TONHOUSG.
       AUTHOR.              FRED HAYNES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        AUG 28, 1990.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *D***************************************************************
      *D*                                                             *
      *D*  THIS PROGRAM REPORTS ON THOSE ITEMS WHICH HAVE ONHAND      *
      *D*  QUANTITIES WHICH EXCEED PROJECTED USAGE.  USAGE IS         *
      *D*  PROJECTED USING EITHER STR-MTH-FCST * # OF MONTHS OR       *
      *D*  BY SUMMING THE AMOUNTS OF MONTHLY USAGE IN THE USAGE FILE. *
      *D*  SLOW MOVER, OVERAGE, INSURANCE AND OBSOLETE ITEMS MAY BE   *
      *D*  EXCLUDED AS WELL AS ALLOWING INSUREANCE ITEMS TO APPEAR    *
      *D*  EXCLUSIVELY.                                               *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D***************************************************************
      *C*
      *C* CR KALMAN        4/26/94            REQUEST 6490
      *C* REMOVED PORTABLILITY COPYLIBS.
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C 09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON R33 EXCLUDE NEW DATES COMPARISONS
      *C   AND ON THE SLOW MOVER DATE COMPARISON.
      *C
      *C  08/15/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
                               C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDITM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0802
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDOR-VN-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USAGEFIL-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RCD.
       01  PRINT-RCD                     PIC X(132).

       COPY MTLSSORT IN COPYLIB.

